Begin3
Title:          ml85p
Version:        0.2.0
Entered-date:   03/11/2002
Description:    A driver for the Samsung ML-85G, a GDI printer (winprinter).
				It works by piping data to it from ghostscript at the
				ppmraw format.
				The driver works at full speed and resolution (600x600 dpi)
				but have no other bells-and-whistles. It is considered
				alpha-level software. 
Keywords:       GDI winprinter device driver ghostscript 
Author:         rildo@pragana.net (Rildo Pragana) 
Maintained-by:  rildo@pragana.net (Rildo Pragana)
Primary-site:   ibiblio.org/pub/Linux/hardware/drivers 
                30kB ml85p-0.2.0.tar.gz
Alternate-site: 
Original-site:  pragana.net
                30kB ml85p-0.2.0.tar.gz
Platforms:      Linux, *BSD (with x86 cpu) 
Copying-policy: GPL 
End

